eadIdx.x`: 0\n     - `threadIdx.y`: 0 to 255\n     - `threadIdx.z`: 0\n\n2. **\u7d22\u5f15\u8868\u8fbe\u5f0f**\uff1a\n   - \u539f\u59cb\u6307\u6570\u8868\u8fbe\u5f0f\uff1a\n     ```cpp\n     int idx = threadIdx.y * blockDim.z +threadIdx.z;\n     idx = idx +threadIdx.x * gridDim.y * blockDim"
